-- 141: 80s POP MINING -> SOLO -> HARD TECHNO.
-- Session arc, all on one take (recordings/jam-20261004-1103.wav):
--   1. 120 BPM groove with hooks mined from ~/tunepile (index/tunepile.db, FTS5).
--   2. Kick became "x x - - x x x - -" (9 steps); everything reworked around it.
--   3. Kick + clap dropped; then all parts except the melody dropped for a solo.
--   4. Melody extended to an 8-bar arc, big regular dub delay + big reverb,
--      then chopped hard (chop 16).
--   5. A NEW hard techno beat + rolling bass dropped in underneath (NOT the old
--      9-step figure). This file reflects the final state.
-- Melody (d6) — a-ha, "Take On Me" (1985):
--   tabs-tidal/Emil_Bulls_-_Take_On_Me.gp3-*.tidal. Key: F#m / A major
--   (a b cs d e fs gs; the lift phrase's F natural was corrected to fs5).
--   gain slow 16 (0.62..1.15 saw); regular dub delay ddSend 0.7, delaytime 3/8,
--   feedback 0.55, ddLp 3800/ddHp 300, ddCross 0.5, lock 1; big verb
--   verbSend 0.6, size 0.92, room 0.75, verbT60 6.
-- Hooks used earlier, now silent: arpeggio (d5, Tears For Fears "Everybody
-- Wants To Rule The World"), bass (d4 earlier, "Billie Jean" contour),
-- pad (d11, vi-IV-I-V in F#m).
-- Sources: bd/cp/hh/ho Dirt-Samples + dubsynth, hoRhodes (project DSP).
-- Mix: per-stream gain deliberate, master UNITY as in 139/140.
setcps 0.5

d1 $ s "bd*4" # gain 1.35 # shape 0.55 # hpf 28

d2 $ s "~ cp ~ cp" # gain 0.95 # hpf 300 # sz 0.4 # room 0

d3 $ s "[~ ho]*4" # gain 0.5 # speed 1.6 # pan 0.58

d4 $ note "fs1*16" # s "dubsynth" # waveMix 0.55 # cutoff 185 # fenv 1.1 # drive 0.85 # sustain 0.09 # gain 0.9

d5 $ silence

d6 $ chop 16 $ slow 2 $ note "<[fs5 cs5 a4 e5 fs5 fs5 d5 b4 b4 e5 e5 gs5 gs5 a5 ~ ~] [a5 e5 cs5 fs5 a5 a5 fs5 d5 d5 fs5 fs5 b5 ~ cs6 ~ ~] [cs6 b5 a5 gs5 a5 fs5 e5 cs5 d5 b4 a4 gs4 a4 ~ ~ ~] [fs5 cs5 a4 e5 fs5 fs5 d5 b4 b4 e5 e5 gs5 gs5 a5 ~ ~]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain (slow 16 $ range 0.62 1.15 saw) # cutoff 4300 # release 0.15 # sustain 0.1 # ddSend 0.7 # lock 1 # delaytime (3/8) # delayfeedback 0.55 # ddLp 3800 # ddHp 300 # ddCross 0.5 # verbSend 0.6 # size 0.92 # room 0.75 # verbT60 6 # verbDamp 0.35 # verbHp 250 # verbWidth 0.9

d7 $ silence

d8 $ silence

d9 $ silence

d10 $ silence

d11 $ silence

d12 $ silence
